---
manual: events.hover
lines: [2200, 2203]
testability: interactive
display: native
ledger: H5
----------- app code
$hovered = []
Shoes.app width: 400, height: 300 do
  $slot = stack width: 200, height: 100 do
    hover { |slot| $hovered << slot }
  end
end
----------- test code
move_mouse 50, 50
assert_equal [$slot], $hovered, "the block gets the slot that was hovered over"
